    "body": "I am also experiencing this issue in one repository, but not my others. Similar to the OP, I have a repository set up in a separate volume on macOS.\r\n\r\nMy main volume is `AFPS`, while the volume I have this repository in is `APFS (Case-sensitive)`, just in case that could matter.\r\n\r\n### Not working repository\r\n\r\nPath: `/Volumes/Opentrons/opentrons`\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>env STARSHIP_LOG=trace starship module git_branch</summary>\r\n\r\n```\r\n[TRACE] - (starship): Parsed arguments: Cli {\r\n    command: Module {\r\n        name: Some(\r\n            \"git_branch\",\r\n        ),\r\n        list: false,\r\n        properties: Properties {\r\n            status_code: None,\r\n            pipestatus: None,\r\n            terminal_width: 362,\r\n            path: None,\r\n            logical_path: None,\r\n            cmd_duration: None,\r\n            keymap: \"viins\",\r\n            jobs: 0,\r\n        },\r\n    },\r\n}\r\n[DEBUG] - (starship::config): STARSHIP_CONFIG is not set\r\n[DEBUG] - (starship::config): Using default config path: /Users/mc/.config/starship.toml\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::utils): Trying to read from \"/Users/mc/.config/starship.toml\"\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::utils): File read successfully\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::config): Config file content: \"\r\ncommand_timeout = 1000\r\n\"\r\n[DEBUG] - (starship::config): Config parsed: Table({\"command_timeout\": Integer(1000)})\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::context): Received completed pipestatus of None\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::config): No config found for \"git_branch\": Option \"git_branch\" not found\r\n[DEBUG] - (starship::context): Failed to find git repo: Could find a git repository in '/Volumes/Opentrons/opentrons' or in any of its parents within device limits below '/Volumes'\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::modules): Took 273.382µs to compute module \"git_branch\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n### Working repository\r\n\r\nPath: `/Users/mc/projects/tracespace`\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>env STARSHIP_LOG=trace starship module git_branch</summary>\r\n\r\n```\r\n[TRACE] - (starship): Parsed arguments: Cli {\r\n    command: Module {\r\n        name: Some(\r\n            \"git_branch\",\r\n        ),\r\n        list: false,\r\n        properties: Properties {\r\n            status_code: None,\r\n            pipestatus: None,\r\n            terminal_width: 118,\r\n            path: None,\r\n            logical_path: None,\r\n            cmd_duration: None,\r\n            keymap: \"viins\",\r\n            jobs: 0,\r\n        },\r\n    },\r\n}\r\n[DEBUG] - (starship::config): STARSHIP_CONFIG is not set\r\n[DEBUG] - (starship::config): Using default config path: /Users/mc/.config/starship.toml\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::utils): Trying to read from \"/Users/mc/.config/starship.toml\"\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::utils): File read successfully\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::config): Config file content: \"\r\ncommand_timeout = 1000\r\n\"\r\n[DEBUG] - (starship::config): Config parsed: Table({\"command_timeout\": Integer(1000)})\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::context): Received completed pipestatus of None\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::config): No config found for \"git_branch\": Option \"git_branch\" not found\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::context): Found git repo: Repository { kind: WorkTree { is_linked: false }, git_dir: \"/Users/mc/projects/tracespace/.git\", work_dir: Some(\"/Users/mc/projects/tracespace\") }, (trust: Full)\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::config): Parsing color_string: purple\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::config): Read predefined color: purple\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::modules): Took 1.628584ms to compute module \"git_branch\"\r\non  v5 %\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n",
