    "body": "> How did you set up the repository? Please also share your git config.\r\n\r\nRepo setup:\r\n```bash\r\ngit init\r\n```\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Git Config:</summary>\r\n\r\n```\r\ncredential.helper=osxkeychain\r\ncore.autocrlf=input\r\ncore.editor=code -w\r\ncore.pager=\r\nuser.name=User\r\nuser.email=contact@domain.com\r\ncolor.status.branch=14 normal\r\ncolor.status.added=10 normal\r\ncolor.status.updated=10 normal\r\ncolor.status.localbranch=14 normal\r\ncolor.status.changed=11 normal\r\ncolor.status.header=normal\r\ncolor.status.remotebranch=13 normal\r\ncolor.status.nobranch=1 normal italic\r\ncolor.status.unmerged=9 normal\r\ncolor.status.untracked=normal dim\r\ncolor.branch.plain=14 normal dim\r\ncolor.branch.remote=13 normal dim\r\ncolor.branch.current=14 normal\r\ncolor.branch.local=14 normal dim\r\ncolor.branch.upstream=13 normal\r\ncolor.remote.hint=normal dim\r\ncolor.remote.success=2 normal\r\ncolor.remote.error=1 normal\r\ncolor.remote.warning=3 normal\r\ncolor.interactive.header=8 normal bold\r\ncolor.interactive.prompt=15 4\r\ncolor.interactive.help=8 normal\r\ncolor.interactive.error=1 normal italic\r\ncolor.diff.commit=3 normal\r\ncolor.diff.newmoved=14 normal\r\ncolor.diff.oldmovedalternativedimmed=4 normal dim\r\ncolor.diff.frag=8 normal ul\r\ncolor.diff.oldmovedalternative=12 normal dim\r\ncolor.diff.contextbold=normal bold\r\ncolor.diff.newbold=10 normal bold\r\ncolor.diff.context=normal\r\ncolor.diff.oldmoved=14 normal dim\r\ncolor.diff.oldbold=9 normal dim bold\r\ncolor.diff.newmoveddimmed=6 normal\r\ncolor.diff.func=8 normal ul\r\ncolor.diff.meta=8 normal\r\ncolor.diff.newdimmed=2 normal\r\ncolor.diff.newmovedalternative=12 normal\r\ncolor.diff.new=10 normal\r\ncolor.diff.newmovedalternativedimmed=4 normal\r\ncolor.diff.whitespace=normal 9\r\ncolor.diff.oldmoveddimmed=6 normal dim\r\ncolor.diff.olddimmed=1 normal dim\r\ncolor.diff.old=9 normal dim\r\ncolor.decorate.branch=14 normal\r\ncolor.decorate.tag=3 normal\r\ncolor.decorate.remotebranch=13 normal\r\ncolor.decorate.stash=8 normal\r\ncolor.decorate.grafted=1 normal italic\r\ncolor.decorate.head=14 normal dim\r\ndiff.colormoved=zebra\r\ncommit.verbose=true\r\ncore.repositoryformatversion=0\r\ncore.filemode=false\r\ncore.bare=false\r\ncore.logallrefupdates=true\r\ncore.ignorecase=true\r\ncore.precomposeunicode=true\r\n```\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nThe issue may indeed be related to being on an external volume or the file system used.  Starship v1.10+ stopped showing info for Git repos on the external volume (ExFAT), but when the directories were copied over to the home directory on the system drive (APFS), info for the Git repos were displayed by Starship.",
