    "updated_at": "2022-08-30T16:50:59Z",
    "body": "I've confirmed the bug with exFAT. Unlike with other macOS file systems, the `.git` directory can be opened in file-mode, which leads to it being incorrectly treated as a (broken) gitdir worktree file.",
